      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "The technician is using infrared thermography to detect a pronounced thermal anomaly in the electric motor.",
          "grammar": "use A to B",
          "ja": "技術者は赤外線熱画像診断を使って、電動モーターの顕著な熱的異常を検出しています。",
          "type": "gist",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The intense red and orange region indicates an abnormal buildup of heat within the motor assembly.",
          "grammar": "indicate＋名詞",
          "ja": "強い赤色とオレンジ色の領域は、モーター内部に異常な熱が蓄積していることを示しています。",
          "type": "detail",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Such excessive heating may be symptomatic of an incipient mechanical or electrical malfunction.",
          "grammar": "may be / symptomatic of",
          "ja": "このような過度の発熱は、初期段階の機械的または電気的な故障の兆候である可能性があります。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The handheld thermal camera enables the worker to identify temperature differences without making direct contact with the equipment.",
          "grammar": "enable O to / without＋動名詞",
          "ja": "手持ちの熱画像カメラにより、作業員は設備に直接触れることなく温度差を確認できます。",
          "type": "detail",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "The worker's helmet, safety glasses, and gloves suggest that the inspection is being conducted in a potentially hazardous industrial environment.",
          "grammar": "suggest that / 現在進行受動態",
          "ja": "ヘルメット、安全メガネ、手袋から、この点検が潜在的な危険を伴う工業環境で行われていることがうかがえます。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "If the anomaly were ignored, continued overheating could cause components to deteriorate and eventually result in equipment failure.",
          "grammar": "仮定法過去 / could",
          "ja": "この異常を放置すれば、過熱が続いて部品が劣化し、最終的に設備故障につながる可能性があります。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Detecting the problem at an early stage allows preventive maintenance to be carried out before the machinery suffers critical damage.",
          "grammar": "動名詞主語 / allow O to / before",
          "ja": "問題を早期に発見することで、機械が重大な損傷を受ける前に予防保全を実施できます。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Thermal monitoring can mitigate operational risks by revealing faults that may not be visible during an ordinary visual inspection.",
          "grammar": "by＋動名詞 / 関係代名詞that",
          "ja": "熱監視は、通常の目視点検では確認できない可能性のある故障を明らかにすることで、運転上のリスクを軽減できます。",
          "type": "inference",
          "points": 40
        },
        {
          "text": "Overall, the scene provides useful practice in describing thermography, thermal anomalies, preventive maintenance, equipment malfunction, industrial safety, and fault detection.",
